    "category": "Spec-specific",
    "question": "What does TS 23.502 describe regarding 5G procedures?",
    "selected_release": "18",
    "selected_specifications": [
      "TS 23.502"
    ],
    "actual_behavior": "TS 23.502 describes the Stage 2 procedures and Network Function Services for the 5G system architecture [CHUNK_ID: TS_23.502_18.0.0_70]. It covers various aspects of 5G procedures, including PDU Session Establishment [CHUNK_ID: TS_23.502_18.0.0_2549], 5GS integration with TSN [CHUNK_ID: TS_23.502_18.0.0_2549], and interworking with the TSN deployed in the transport network [CHUNK_ID: TS_23.502_18.0.0_2549]. Additionally, it mentions procedures for UE Context, Security Context, and Mobility Restriction List [CHUNK_ID: TS_23.502_18.0.0_244], as well as 5GS-EPS interworking without N26 procedure [CHUNK_ID: TS_23.502_18.0.0_1159].",
